# Backend (`apps/api`)

## Stack

NestJS 11, Prisma 6, PostgreSQL. Config via `@nestjs/config` loaders in `src/config/configuration.ts`. Swagger available in dev.

## Module pattern

- `*.module.ts`, `*.controller.ts`, `*.service.ts`, optional `*.repository.ts`.
- DTOs: `class-validator` + `class-transformer` in `dto/` folders.
- Cross-cutting: `src/common/guards`, `filters/http-exception.filter.ts`, `interceptors/transform.interceptor.ts`.

## Admin CMS API

`modules/admin-cms/`: CRUD for meets, series, episodes, speakers, competencies, resources, platform settings, team upload endpoints (`team-meets`, `team-series`). CMS status helpers in `utils/cms-status.util.ts`. URL/metadata fields: `homepageTags`, `displayPriority`, etc. (see Prisma + `homepage-tags.constant.ts`).

## Integrations (env-driven)

| Concern | Providers |
|---------|-----------|
| Storage | `LOCAL` (disk under `STORAGE_LOCAL_PATH`) or `S3` |
| Search | `postgres` full-text or `elasticsearch` |
| Mail | `console` or `smtp` |
| Push | `console` or `webpush` (VAPID) |
| AI | `gemini` (primary); key via `GEMINI_API_KEY` — not `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` |

## Streaming

`videos` module: `GET .../playback`, `GET .../stream` with HTTP Range support (`streaming.service.ts`).

## Migrations & seed

- Dev: `pnpm db:migrate` (runs `prisma migrate dev` in api package).
- Deploy: `pnpm --filter @knowledgehub/api db:migrate:deploy`.
- Seed: `pnpm db:seed` — sample data; real login is Google OAuth.

## API style

- Prefix: `API_PREFIX` default `api/v1`.
- Return shapes should match `@knowledgehub/types` where exported.
- Avoid duplicate keys in object literals when mapping Prisma → admin DTOs.
